			description: ["Oda: \"Nine people, a hundred and twelve days to the end of March, and grain for eighty-one of them. That is thirty-one days of nothing.\"", "", "Take her token to the counter and stand there while she counts.", "", "The &bwinter checklist&r and the granary blueprint go into your book, and Oda leaves the ledger open."]
