		{
			id: "76C4B9946F943E38"
			title: "Fill the Granary's Twelve Alcoves"
			subtitle: "One drawer per alcove, at the Lantern Float."
			icon: "storagedrawers:oak_full_drawers_1"
			description: ["Oda: \"Twelve alcoves, twelve drawers. Do not improvise on me.\"", "", "Craft 12 &aOak Full Drawers&r — six oak planks around a wooden chest — and put one in each marked alcove in the granary at the Lantern Float. Any order is right.", "", "They arrive holding the town's stock, and the Granary Waystone goes up outside. Drawers and ducts: &6Power and Logistics&r."]
