			title: "Fill Three Bottles at the Spring"
			subtitle: "Above the hedge garden, with Halden."
			icon: "valley:spring_water"
			description: ["Halden: \"There's a spring above the hedge garden. Josie used it for the quartz, not the tea.\"", "", "Follow him up, pour out the 3 &aSpring Water&r bottles he sent you home with in the summer, and fill them there. He tops you up to six.", "", "Spring Water is what grows &bcertus quartz&r, and Josie's jar of sixteen crystals has sat on his shelf for four years."]
