			description: ["Marnie: \"Four loaves, two pies, two cakes. Bank the oven right and you'll get the lot out of one heat.\"", "", "Bake 4 &aBread&r, 2 Chocolate Pies and 2 Cakes in the inn kitchen. Milk and eggs came with the larder crate; cocoa is the one thing this valley does not grow. Oda keeps a tin behind the counter — see the &6Oda's Counter&r chapter — or take the jungle pods off a trip east.", "", "It stocks the inn for the Supper, opens Pip's courier board, and it is half of what lets Halden read the Plate."]
