			description: ["Marnie: \"Eight on the rack — salt, air and a week. No cleverness required, which is why I like it.\"", "", "Smoke 8 Ham into &aSmoked Ham&r on the stove in the inn kitchen, hang all eight on Josie's drying rack in the shed, and tick this.", "", "Thirty-two cured meat into the granary. Ninety-one days covered, twenty-one short, and Oda has stopped saying the number out loud."]
