			description: ["Bram: \"Cell on the wall, duct to the inn, and Marnie gets her fridge. Don't overthink it.\"", "", "Charge a Thermal &aEnergy Cell&r off your dynamos, then run Energy Duct from the mill until the line ends within 12 blocks of the inn. The preserves quest feeds this one — Marnie will not open the inn wall until her shelves are up.", "", "The Cell Frame is 12 Scrip on Oda's board. The Fridge, Sink and Milk Jar arrive made, with four Works Power Taps to hang them on the line."]
