			description: ["Halden: \"She kept that jar on my shelf for four years and told me I'd know when. I know when.\"", "", "Plant Certus Quartz Seeds in his &aSpring Water&r and grow 32 Certus Quartz Crystals. Josie's sixteen seed the first batch; four Growth Accelerators make every batch after it overnight work.", "", "His compass leads to a sky-stone meteorite, and the four presses are in the chest inside. The whole system: &6Storage Network&r.", "", "Growth is slow even accelerated. Set it going and spend the wait in &6Ores and Mining&r or on Oda's board — the crystals keep."]
