			icon: "valley:kettle_plate_a"
			description: ["Halden: \"I have been able to read that hand for four years. I have been finding reasons not to. Give it here before I find another one.\"", "", "Bring the &aKettle Plate&r from the adit to Halden at his cottage and put it in his hands.", "", "The iron door in your cellar turns a quarter and stops. Journal Part Two opens and the reactor recipes appear — the casings still want Josie's Turbine Notes."]
