			subtitle: "Down the stairs. The door is standing open."
			icon: "minecraft:iron_door"
			description: ["Halden, from the top of the stairs: \"I carried the chalk up for her and went home. I'm not reading the bottom half over your shoulder.\"", "", "Go back down the stairs under the farmhouse. The door finished turning some time in the night. Stand in the cellar and read the whole wall, every line, to the bottom.", "", "Her chalk copies itself into the journal, the cellar waystone is yours, and the &aWorks Pick&r is in the chest by the stairs with her blueprint."]
