 id: "61B004C09F66A758", type: "xp_levels", auto: "no_toast", xp_levels: 3 }, { id: "57BE6CB562416C48", type: "toast", title: "She Built a Power Plant", auto: "enabled", description: "Next: the long table in the square. Tobin is at the collapsed adit with a shovel and a theory about where the Works opens." }]
